  3. Evaluator failure (python3 shims, real gate check at tier 2): exit 0/1/2/127/137 (kill -9)/143 (TERM), non-script shim,
     PATH with no python3, PYTHONHOME=/nonexistent, shim printing multi-line noise + exit 12 -> all refuse with
     `critical-glob-unreadable`, one stderr line. exit 10 -> plain critical-glob; exit 11 -> no hit (the deliberate no-hit code, only
